{"parse":{"title":"Bronze","pageid":571,"revid":46769,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Bronze</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f2/Bronze.png/revision/latest?cb=20210214052222\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bronze\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f2/Bronze.png/revision/latest?cb=20210214052222\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f2/Bronze.png/revision/latest?cb=20210214052222 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f2/Bronze.png/revision/latest?cb=20210214052222 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bronze\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-key=\"Bronze.png\" data-image-name=\"Bronze.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i>A strong alloy of copper and tin.</i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Metal</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Internal ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bronze</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">Forge</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Smelter\" title=\"Smelter\">Smelter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Building, Crafting</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Weight</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">Stack</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">12.0</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">30</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"teleport\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"Can go through wood portal?\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Teleportable</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">No</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Crafting Materials</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Copper\" title=\"Copper\">Copper</a> x2</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Tin\" title=\"Tin\">Tin</a> x1</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Bronze</b> is a crafting material crafted by processing two <a href=\"/wiki/Copper\" title=\"Copper\">Copper</a> and one <a href=\"/wiki/Tin\" title=\"Tin\">Tin</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Forge\" title=\"Forge\">Forge</a>. Bronze can also be obtained by destroying the <a href=\"/wiki/Standing_brazier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standing brazier\">standing braziers</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Cave\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Frost Cave\">Frost Caves</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Mountain\" title=\"Mountain\">Mountain</a> biome, or by destroying <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_pot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ancient pot\">Ancient pots</a> found in ruins and <a href=\"/wiki/Putrid_Hole\" title=\"Putrid Hole\">Putrid Holes</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Ashlands\" title=\"Ashlands\">Ashlands</a> biome. Additionally, Bronze can also be obtained by directly smelting the uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Scrap_bronze\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scrap bronze\">Scrap bronze</a> in a <a href=\"/wiki/Smelter\" title=\"Smelter\">Smelter</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBronze%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsecti